Green-lit single item from the v6 brief (rest still paused). Adds a segmented,
persisted (localStorage) Kanban ⇄ Table toggle on the unified Work board.

- Kanban (default): unchanged — status columns + epic group headers.
- Table: the SAME items as a tabular list — rows grouped by epic (collapsible
  epic group rows, "No epic" last), columns Title · Status · Priority · Owner ·
  Live · PR. Status is the sort geometry (Backlog→Ready→In progress→Done→Cancelled),
  never a filter. PR column is an honest SEAM (issue↔PR link 56461780).
- Same filter bar (type/priority/text + show-closed) drives BOTH views; epic focus
  narrows both. Rows/cards are entity links (route-driven detail). No swimlanes.
- Reuses the same encodings as card() (STATUS_GLYPH, pmark, pulse) in a row atom.

Interaction-verified: toggle persists across navigation (ls=table), filters work in
Table (bug→25 rows, never-empty), epic groups collapse/expand (240→225→240), rows
open #/issue/:id. 12 tests pass.

Refs d1d7aedc. Rest of v6 brief (Memory Stream ce75d317, Architecture rename
83690fd4, plans-as-workfolders f4a421d7) remains paused for user review.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
